===Noun===
{{ko-noun|hanja=人形|rv=inhyeong}}

# [[doll]]; [[action figure]]; [[puppet]]; [[little]] [[human]] [[form]]

====Usage notes====
When {{ko-inline|인형|inhyeong}} refers to toys for girls, it is translated as "[[doll]]s".  When it refers to toys for boys, it is translated as "[[action figure]]s".  Boys may take offense to saying that they play with "dolls".

